:: StoryTitle
The Waters of Time

:: StoryData
{
  "id": "acque-del-tempo",
  "author": "Specula Elementae",
  "startPassage": "prologo"
}

:: prologo [opening]
A Droplet falls into your hands. Water is patient, it flows little by little, circles around stones, and helps every plant grow.

[[Begin->inizio-avventura]]

:: inizio-avventura
Water always finds its path. Play calmly: you will see that being gentle is a great strength.

:: evento-round-3 [mid-story]
A small wave crosses the field. The enemies become a little confused. Sometimes staying balanced is as good as winning.

```gameEffects
{
  "drawCountsAsWin": true,
  "roundSpecific": 3
}
```

:: epilogo-vittoria [ending victory]
You followed every current with calm. Now you know that water teaches us to listen, to wait, and to help life begin.

:: epilogo-sconfitta [ending defeat]
Even rivers meet stones and waterfalls along the way. But water never stops: you will flow again, with more patience and more trust.
